return ['domain'=>'zinn-reseller','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-reseller','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:38:01+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:38:01+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Reseller Toolkit'=>'Zinn® Reseller Toolkit','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller','Sell Zinn Digital® hosting from your own WordPress site — footprint-free PBN, WordPress, WooCommerce, agency, reseller, cloud and VPS hosting. Search and offer domains from your reseller account, sign your clients straight into their hosting panel, and provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order is paid.'=>'Uza mwenyeji wa wavuti wa Zinn Digital® kutoka kwenye tovuti yako mwenyewe ya WordPress — PBN isiyo na alama ya SEO, WordPress, WooCommerce, wakala, muuzaji upya, wingu na mwenyeji wa VPS. Tafuta na utoe vikoa kutoka kwa akaunti yako ya muuzaji upya, ingiza wateja wako moja kwa moja kwenye paneli yao ya mwenyeji, na uandae mwenyeji kiotomatiki wakati agizo la WooCommerce limelipwa.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','The hosting platform answered with status %d.'=>'Jukwaa la mwenyeji limeshughulikia na hali %d.','Find your domain name'=>'Tafuta jina lako la kikoa','Search'=>'Tafuta','No extensions were checked for that name.'=>'Hakuna viongezeo vilivyoteuliwa kwa jina hilo.','Domain search is unavailable on this site at the moment.'=>'Utafutaji wa vikoa haupatikani kwenye tovuti hii kwa sasa.','We could not reach the domain registry just now. Please try again in a moment.'=>'Hatukuweza kufikia sajili ya kikoa kwa sasa. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya muda mfupi.','The API key is missing or no longer valid. Check it under Settings → Zinn® Reseller.'=>'Ufunguo wa API haupo au hauna nguvu tena. Ukague chini ya Mipangilio → Zinn® Reseller.','This API key does not carry the sites.view permission, which the domain search needs. Add it to the key in your reseller panel, or clear the key here to fall back to the public search.'=>'Ufunguo huu wa API hauna ruhusa ya sites.view ambayo utafutaji wa vikoa unahitaji. Uongeze kwenye ufunguo katika paneli yako ya wauzaji reja reja, ili kufuta ufunguo hapa ili urejee kwenye utafutaji wa umma.','Only administrators see this:'=>'Wasimamizi pekee ndio wanaoona hili:','We could not check this one — try again'=>'Hatukuweza kukagua hii — jaribu tena','Already registered'=>'Imesajiliwa tayari','Available — ask us for a price'=>'Inapatikana — tuulize bei','Available — %1$s %2$s for the first year'=>'Inapatikana — %1$s %2$s kwa mwaka wa kwanza','Register it'=>'Jisajili','Manage my hosting'=>'Simamia mwenyeji wangu','Please sign in first.'=>'Tafadhali ingia kwanza.','This account is not linked to a hosting service yet.'=>'Akaunti hii haijaunganishwa na huduma ya mwenyeji bado.','The hosting platform did not return a sign-in link.'=>'Jukwaa la uenyeji halikurejesha kiungo cha kuingia.','Reseller Toolkit'=>'Zana za Wauzaji Upya','Account'=>'Akaunti','Features'=>'Vipengele','Styling'=>'Mtindo','Your Zinn Digital® reseller account'=>'Akaunti yako ya muuzaji upya ya Zinn Digital®','Create a reseller API key in your Zinn® dashboard under Settings → API keys, and paste it here.'=>'Tengeneza ufunguo wa API wa muuzaji upya katika dashibodi yako ya Zinn® chini ya Mipau ya Mipangilio (Settings) → Funguo za API, kisha ubandike hapa.','Reseller API key'=>'Ufunguo wa API ya muuzaji reja reja','Held on this site only, and never included in an export or a diagnostics report.'=>'Imewekwa kwenye tovuti hii pekee, na haijajumuishwa kamwe katika usafirishwaji au ripoti ya utambuzi.','Plan to provision'=>'Mpango wa kutoa rasilimali','The plan code new customers are put on. Leave blank to be asked each time.'=>'Nambari ya mpango ambayo wateja wapya wanawekwa kwenye. Acha wazi ili kuulizwa kila wakati.','API address'=>'Anwani ya API','Leave this alone unless Zinn® support has asked you to change it.'=>'Acha hili bila kubadilishwa isipokuwa kama msaada wa Zinn® umekuomba ukibadilishe.','Control-panel address'=>'Anwani ya jopo la kudhibiti','Where the “My hosting” link sends your customers.'=>'Mahali ambapo kiungo cha “Huduma yangu ya kukaribisha tovuti” huwapeleka wateja wako.','Domain search'=>'Utafutaji wa kikoa','Provide the [zinn_domain_search] shortcode'=>'Toa nambari fupi ya [zinn_domain_search]','Put the shortcode on any page to let visitors check a domain and buy it through you.'=>'Weka kodi fupi kwenye ukurasa wowote ili kuruhusu wageni kukagua kikoa na kukinunua kupitia wewe.','Panel link'=>'Kiungo cha paneli','Show a “My hosting” link to signed-in customers'=>'Onyesha kiungo cha “Hosting yangu” kwa wateja walioingia kwenye akaunti','WooCommerce provisioning'=>'Utoaji wa WooCommerce','Provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order completes'=>'Weka hosting kiotomatiki oda ya WooCommerce inapokamilika','Only takes effect on orders containing a product you have mapped to a Zinn® plan.'=>'Inaanza kutumika tu kwenye maagizo yaliyo na bidhaa uliyoiweka kwenye mpango wa Zinn®.','Domain search appearance'=>'Muonekano wa utafutaji wa kikoa','This widget renders inside your own theme. Pick a preset, or set your own colours — either way nothing is added to your pages that a visitor can see as ours.'=>'Wijiti hii inajichora ndani ya mandhari yako mwenyewe. Chagua muundo uliowekwa tayari, au weka rangi zako mwenyewe — kwa vyovyote vile hakuna kinachoongezwa kwenye kurasa zako ambacho mgeni anaweza kukiona kama chetu.','Every class the widget uses is listed in the plugin’s readme, so a developer can override anything a preset does not cover.'=>'Kila darasa linalotumiwa na wijeti limeorodheshwa kwenye faili ya kusoma ya programu-jalizi, ili msanidi programu aweze kubatilisha chochote ambacho usanidi haujakifikia.','Follow my theme'=>'Fuata mandhari yangu','Soft'=>'Laini','High contrast'=>'Tofauti kuu','Compact'=>'Finya','Buy-link colour'=>'Rangi ya kiungo cha ununuzi','“Available” colour'=>'Rangi inayopatikana','“Could not check” colour'=>'Rangi ya “Imeshindwa kuangalia”','Error colour'=>'Rangi ya hitilafu','Corner rounding'=>'Kupunguza pembe','Space inside each row'=>'Nafasi ndani ya kila safu','Text size'=>'Ukubwa wa maandishi','Domain-name weight'=>'Uzito wa jina la kikoa','No reseller API key yet.'=>'Bado hakuna ufunguo wa API ya wauzaji reja reja.','Nothing here works until a key is set. Create one in your Zinn® dashboard under Settings → API keys.'=>'Hakuna kinachofanya kazi hapa hadi ufunguo uwekwe. Unda moja katika dashibodi yako ya Zinn® chini ya Mipuga → Funguo za API.','Open my Zinn® dashboard'=>'Fungua dashibodi yangu ya Zinn®','A key is set, but nothing is switched on.'=>'Ufunguo umewekwa, but hakuna kilichowashwa.','None of the three features is enabled, so this plugin is doing nothing on your site. Turn on what you need under Features.'=>'Hakuna hata moja kati ya vipengele hivyo vitatu iliyowashwa, kwa hiyo programu jalizi hii haifanyi chochote kwenye tovuti yako. Washa unachohitaji chini ya Vipengele.','Open Features'=>'Fungua Vipengele','Ready — %d feature switched on.'=>'Tayari — kipengele %d kimewashwa.' . "\0" . 'Tayari — vipengele %d vimewashwa.','Selling from'=>'Inauzwa kutoka','Settings'=>'Mipangilio','No API key yet, so nothing is connected.'=>'Bado hakuna ufunguo wa API, kwa hiyo hakuna kilichounganishwa.','Not connected: %s'=>'Haijaunganishwa: %s','Connected. Your reseller programme is %s.'=>'Imeunganishwa. Programu yako ya wauzaji reja reja ni %s.','No Zinn® API key is configured, so nothing was provisioned.'=>'Hakuna kitufe cha API cha Zinn® kilichosanidiwa, kwa hivyo hakuna kilichotolewa.','This order did not include a domain name, so there was nothing to provision.'=>'Agizo hili halikujumuisha jina la kikoa, kwa hivyo hakukuwa na cha kusanidi.','The hosting platform did not return a site.'=>'Jukwaa la upangishaji halikurejesha tovuti.','Zinn® hosting provisioned for %1$s (service %2$s).'=>'Huduma ya hosting ya Zinn® imetolewa kwa ajili ya %1$s (huduma %2$s).','The hosting platform did not return a client account.'=>'Jukwaa la upangishaji halikurejesha akaunti ya mteja.','Zinn® hosting was NOT provisioned: %s'=>'Uandikishaji wa Zinn® haukuwekwa tayari: %s','Zinn® product line'=>'Safu ya bidhaa ya Zinn®','The Zinn® product line to provision when this product is bought. Leave blank to use the default from the plugin settings.'=>'Safu ya bidhaa ya Zinn® itakayotolewa bidhaa hii inaponunuliwa. Acha wazi ili kutumia chaguo-msingi kutoka kwa mipangilio ya programu jalizi.','Zinn® hosting'=>'Hosting ya Zinn®','Service id'=>'Kitambulisho cha huduma','Nothing provisioned for this order.'=>'Hakuna kilichotolewa kwa agizo hili.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Imesohifadhiwa. Andika thamani mpya ili kuichukua nafasi.','Filter this list…'=>'Chuja orodha hii…','Filter this list'=>'Chuja orodha hii','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Hakuna kinacholingana na kichujio hicho.','Add a row'=>'Ongeza safu','Remove this row'=>'Ondoa safu hii','Remove'=>'Ondoa','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — muhtasari','Overview'=>'Muhtasari','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kila plagi ya Zinn® kwenye tovuti hii, na ikiwa inafanya kazi.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Hakuna muunganisho unaohitajika kwa programu-jalizi hii.','Open settings'=>'Fungua mipangilio','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Huna ruhusa ya kubadilisha mipangilio hii.','Settings sections'=>'Sehemu za mipangilio','Support'=>'Usaidizi','Save changes'=>'Hifadhi mabadiliko','Tools'=>'Zana','Export settings'=>'Hamisha mipangilio','Reset to defaults'=>'Weka upya kwa chaguo-msingi','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Hii inarudisha kila mpangilio kwenye programu-jalizi hii katika hali yake ya awali. Uendelee?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Uchunguzi wa utatuzi wa usaidizi','Import a settings file'=>'Ingiza faili la mipangilio','Import'=>'Ingiza','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Faili zilizohamishwa hazina nywila, tokeni au funguo za API kamwe — utahitaji kuingiza tena kwenye tovuti mpya.','Settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio imehifadhiwa.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Kila mpangilio kwenye programu-jalizi hii umerudi kwenye hali yake ya kwanza.','Done.'=>'Imekamilika.','That action is not available.'=>'Kitendo hicho hakipatikani.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Faili hiyo haikuweza kusomwa. Chochagua faili ya mipangilio iliyosafirishwa kutoka kwa programu jalizi ya Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Faili hiyo ni kubwa mno kuwa usafirishaji wa mipangilio.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Faili hilo sio usafirishaji wa mipangilio ya Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Faili hiyo ilisafirishwa kutoka kwa programu-jalizi nyingine (%s), kwa hivyo kuiingiza hapa kutahifadhi mipangilio ambayo programu-jalizi hii haielewi.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'Mpangilio %d umeingizwa. Manenosiri na funguo za API haziwahi kuwepo kwenye usafirishaji nje, kwa hiyo ingiza hizo tena.' . "\0" . 'Mipangilio %d imeletwa. Nywila na funguo za API haziingizwi kamwe kwenye usafirishaji, kwa hivyo weka hizo tena.','Connected'=>'Imeunganishwa','Connecting…'=>'Inaunganisha…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Imeunganishwa, lakini kuna jambo linahitaji umakini','Not connected'=>'Haijaunganishwa','Running on your own account'=>'Inayoendesha kwenye akaunti yako mwenyewe','We could not check this'=>'Hatukuweza kuangalia hili','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Programu jalizi hii haikusema kwa nini. Tuma ripoti ya uchunguzi na tutaiangalia.','Connection status'=>'Hali ya muunganisho','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Mara ya mwisho kukaguliwa ilikuwa muda wa %s uliopita.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(inafungua kwenye kichupo kipya)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma hii kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Hivi ndivyo vitakavyotumwa hasa — hakuna kingine, wala chochote kilichofichwa. Nenosiri lako, tokeni na funguo za API hazimo ndani yake.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Ripoti ya uchunguzi itakayotumwa','Copy to clipboard'=>'Nakili kwenye ubao klipu','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma ripoti hii kwa msaada wa Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Tunakufungulia tiketi ya usaidizi na kukujibu kupitia barua pepe. Ikiwa hutaki kuituma, nakili hapo juu na uiweke kwenye tiketi wewe mwenyewe.','Copied'=>'Imenakopwa','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Hatukuweza kufika Zinn Digital® kutoka kwenye seva hii (%s). Nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu na ufungue tikiti badala yake — hakuna chochote kuhusu mipangilio yako kilicho kibaya.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn® umepokea ripoti yako na utajibu kupitia barua pepe.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn® una ripoti yako — rejeleo %s — na utajibu kupitia barua pepe.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Umetuma ripoti kadhaa kwa muda mfupi. Subiri dakika chache kisha ujaribu tena — zile za awali zimefika.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuweza kupokea ripoti hiyo kwa sasa — hilo ni tatizo letu, si lako. Jaribu tena hivi karibuni, au nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu kwenye tiketi.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Ripoti imekataliwa (HTTP %d). Iakili hapo juu na ufungue tikiti, ukitaja namba hiyo.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya watumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Hosting ya Zinn® ya WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamiaji wa bure na kidhibiti kilichoundwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha zaidi ya tovuti moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti, vikoa na nafasi za viungo zilizowekwa tayari, huku pesa zikiwekwa kwa usalama hadi pande zote mbili zitakapofurahi.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ajiri watu ambao wanafanya kazi hii kama njia yao ya maisha','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wafanyakazi huru: vinjari huduma zaidi ya 10,000 zilizotengenezwa tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, watengenezaji programu na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwaruhusu watoe zabuni.','Style preset'=>'Kielelezo cha mtindo kilichowekwa mapema','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Sehemu ya kuanzia. Chochote kilicho hapa chini kinabatilisha hili.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Tumia rangi na saizi zangu mwenyewe','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Wacha hili lisiwashwe na kielelezo kitatumutumiwa jinsi kilivyo.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Tazama maelezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sasisho lililopakuliwa limeshindwa ukaguzi wa uadilifu na halijasakinishwa.']];